<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh June trade deficit widens to $303 mln.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh June trade deficit widens to $303 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's trade deficit widened to $303 million in June from 236.5 million in May and dropped from $425.8 million in June 1995, central bank officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		(Balance of trade in US$ millions)</p>
<p>			  June	May	June 95</p>
<p>    Exports	   379.0     336.5    272.2</p>
<p>    Imports	   682.0     573.0    698.0</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
</text>
